<title>USA: Yurie Systems appoints D'Andrea CFO.</title>
<headline>Yurie Systems appoints D'Andrea CFO.</headline>
<dateline>LANDOVER, Md. 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yurie Systems Inc said Monday it named Harry D'Andrea as chief financial officer.</p>
<p>D'Andrea replaces Charles Marantz, who is leaving the company to pursue new opportunities, the company said.</p>
<p>D'Andrea was previously chief financial officer at American Communications Services Inc.</p>
